<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cen.bank cuts four of its five repo rates.</title>
<headline>Hungary cen.bank cuts four of its five repo rates.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) cut four of its five repo rates by 0.25 percentage points each, the NBH said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The NBH cut the overnight and one-week repo rates to 28.75 percent each and reduced its one-week reverse repo to 22.75 percent and its one-month reverse repo to 23.25 percent, it said.  </p>
<p>The NBH left the overnight reverse repo unchanged at 17.50 percent, it said.</p>
<p>On August 5 the NBH cut the same four repo rates by 0.25 percentage points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
